; FlexClock recommended FinishLynx scoreboard script.
; Network (UDP), port 2042, Single Byte.
; Running Time Normal, Results Auto; enable Send results if armed.
; Supports event headers, live time, results and messages.

;;TimeOfDay
\01\=0T\0a%12.12s\B4\I4\R0\03\04

;;TimeRunning
\01T\0a%12.12s\03\04
;\01\=0T\0a%12.12s\03\04

;;TimeStopped
\01T\0a%12.12s\03\04

;;StartListHeader
\02S\0a%s\0a

;;StartList

;;StartListTrailer
\03\04

;;ResultsHeader
\02R\0a%s\0a

;;Result
\01%-3.3s\0a
\04%-30.30s\0a
\06%-10.10s

;;ResultsTrailer
\03\04

;;MessageHeader
\00M\0a

;;Message
\01%s\0a

;;MessageTrailer
\03\04
